WEBVTT

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:23.060
Looks like it’s raining again
in this anonymous world

00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:26.480
Where crowds prop up
revolutionaries' screeds

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:30.780
Polarity may as well not exist

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:34.070
Crumbling agony

00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:38.080
We erased the dots we stared at

00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:41.450
Without connecting them
Filling me with loss

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:47.040
Synthetic Sympathy

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:57.760
The desire to be revealed and embraced

00:00:57.890 --> 00:01:02.060
Even solitude is dissolved
in the reticent sea

00:01:02.180 --> 00:01:05.230
Unliberated freedom
leads to senseless crime

00:01:05.350 --> 00:01:07.440
Bursting my eardrums

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:10.730
Sympathy
The sentiments to hurt and be kissed

00:01:10.860 --> 00:01:15.070
Let the vortex of resonating memories
break free of time

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:19.990
Grasping the end of falsehood
to open our eyes

00:01:42.720 --> 00:01:45.060
Shouldn't you be the one saving me?

00:01:46.180 --> 00:01:47.850
Sorry.

00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:52.230
You're useless.

00:01:54.190 --> 00:01:56.030
Anyway, I'm glad you're safe.

00:01:56.190 --> 00:02:00.950
Head for the server room. If we get
an analyst in there, we can strike back.

00:02:01.740 --> 00:02:02.660
Roger.

00:02:14.170 --> 00:02:16.380
No Shindo?

00:02:20.970 --> 00:02:22.890
Get back. I'll take the controls.

00:02:23.220 --> 00:02:24.220
Roger.

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:32.020
Those are our enforcers!

00:02:33.190 --> 00:02:35.400
They plan to take out drones unarmed?

00:02:36.440 --> 00:02:38.650
Are there anti-drone weapons on board?

00:02:38.950 --> 00:02:41.030
Conventional handguns and grenades.

00:02:41.490 --> 00:02:44.870
EMP rounds are only issued to
Public Safety and the NDF.

00:02:45.330 --> 00:02:49.580
Better than nothing. We'll draw its fire
and get the weapons to them.

00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:50.920
Gino!

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:52.420
Roger.

00:03:23.120 --> 00:03:24.320
It dropped something.

00:03:24.450 --> 00:03:25.910
OK. I'll grab it.

00:03:32.710 --> 00:03:34.710
They want us to use these?

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:36.210
There's a device.

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:40.470
I'm glad you're both safe.

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:42.010
Inspector.

00:03:42.880 --> 00:03:44.340
Relation progress.

00:03:44.760 --> 00:03:47.140
The Sibyl System
is controlling the press.

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:51.100
Blocks of reduced safety
have emerged due to area stress.

00:03:51.940 --> 00:03:54.230
Invest in short funds.

00:03:55.060 --> 00:03:57.230
Short selling in these circumstances?

00:03:57.940 --> 00:03:59.940
With the death of Karina Komiya,

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:04.030
the ensuing chaos
will yield massive profits.

00:04:04.870 --> 00:04:08.030
Direct bet on Public Safety Bureau CID.

00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:11.250
How simplistic.

00:04:11.790 --> 00:04:14.250
You could never imitate me.

00:04:14.670 --> 00:04:19.250
Yes, Mr. Shirogane.
Your moves are complex.

00:04:19.670 --> 00:04:23.680
But that also makes you miss
your opportunities to fold.

00:04:25.050 --> 00:04:28.760
I could say the same to you.
Just you watch.

00:04:30.180 --> 00:04:31.100
Let's go!

00:04:54.750 --> 00:04:55.790
Brace for impact!

00:05:17.600 --> 00:05:18.650
Inspector Ignatov!

00:05:24.900 --> 00:05:26.280
Run! It'll self-destruct!

00:05:27.070 --> 00:05:28.070
Gino, fall back!

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:01.860
Damn!

00:06:01.980 --> 00:06:04.690
Kogami,
I'll back you up from outside.

00:06:05.150 --> 00:06:06.610
I'm counting on you, Gino.

00:06:12.950 --> 00:06:15.910
No hope of backup
with the heliport destroyed.

00:06:16.330 --> 00:06:18.370
We'll have to make do on our own.

00:06:19.460 --> 00:06:22.290
What were you doing in an MFA craft?

00:06:22.840 --> 00:06:24.250
It's complicated.

00:06:29.180 --> 00:06:31.760
Thank goodness. I've confirmed three more.

00:06:31.890 --> 00:06:32.930
Shion!

00:06:33.470 --> 00:06:35.720
Oh, is Kogami with you?

00:06:35.850 --> 00:06:37.350
Yeah, I am.

00:06:37.520 --> 00:06:39.270
Kei! I'm glad you're safe!

00:06:39.810 --> 00:06:40.980
Are you safe, too?

00:06:41.100 --> 00:06:43.940
I'm fine. Did something happen to you?

00:06:44.190 --> 00:06:47.070
It's okay, we pulled through.
What's the situation?

00:06:47.740 --> 00:06:51.490
Azusawa's group hijacked the system
and took over the building.

00:06:52.070 --> 00:06:52.990
Any casualties?

00:06:53.950 --> 00:06:55.370
I saw the Bureau Chief fall.

00:06:56.200 --> 00:06:57.580
Unit Two is down.

00:06:58.290 --> 00:07:00.290
Unit Three can't get inside.

00:07:00.870 --> 00:07:05.000
The staff are being held hostage
on the lower floors.

00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:07.670
And Unit One is all right?

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:08.590
Yeah.

00:07:09.220 --> 00:07:13.470
The chief, Todoroki, and Hinakawa
are heading for Dominator Storage.

00:07:13.850 --> 00:07:14.760
And the governor?

00:07:15.260 --> 00:07:18.520
She's with us.
We're going to the server room.

00:07:19.140 --> 00:07:21.230
OK. We'll rendezvous there.

00:07:24.650 --> 00:07:26.650
It's going well.

00:07:27.690 --> 00:07:30.320
Now for the next move.

00:07:34.370 --> 00:07:38.910
Your attention, please. General Affairs
has reported a lost child.

00:07:45.210 --> 00:07:46.000
En!

00:07:46.670 --> 00:07:49.010
The governor's ex-secretary
is the ringleader?!

00:07:49.170 --> 00:07:52.720
I'm transmitting
from the Public Safety Bureau Building.

00:07:53.550 --> 00:07:57.060
Immigrants and latent criminals
are out of control.

00:07:58.010 --> 00:08:02.350
Their ringleader is the governor's
former secretary, En Owanee!

00:08:02.730 --> 00:08:04.190
What is going on?!

00:08:05.150 --> 00:08:09.650
Azusawa will need another culprit
in order to make his getaway.

00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:11.700
We have to rescue her!

00:08:12.110 --> 00:08:13.200
That's the point.

00:08:13.780 --> 00:08:19.330
Azusawa's goal is to keep us
from going to the server floor.

00:08:19.700 --> 00:08:20.950
No way...

00:08:21.370 --> 00:08:24.170
But we can't abandon her. What's the plan?

00:08:27.210 --> 00:08:27.840
Up there!

00:08:36.550 --> 00:08:38.890
Governor Komiya.

00:08:39.560 --> 00:08:40.810
Can you hear me?

00:08:42.060 --> 00:08:43.140
I hear you.

00:08:44.060 --> 00:08:47.110
I'm happy to see
you managed to save Arata.

00:08:47.690 --> 00:08:50.610
I'm afraid the staff are still in danger.

00:08:51.030 --> 00:08:54.780
Why not come back
and announce your resignation?

00:08:55.490 --> 00:08:56.700
Don't answer him.

00:08:57.700 --> 00:09:00.950
Release the hostages,
and I'll do as you say.

00:09:01.700 --> 00:09:04.410
This isn't a negotiation, Governor.

00:09:05.420 --> 00:09:08.630
It's a question of what choice
you're going to make.

00:09:08.750 --> 00:09:10.040
Choice?

00:09:10.670 --> 00:09:12.920
You've made one choice already.

00:09:13.470 --> 00:09:17.300
You fired your trusted partner
the moment you became governor.

00:09:17.890 --> 00:09:22.140
You obeyed your allies
and cracked down on immigrants.

00:09:23.270 --> 00:09:27.900
I know how you feel. You can't
change reality with a vision alone.

00:09:28.650 --> 00:09:31.690
I will change things one day. I'm...

00:09:31.980 --> 00:09:35.070
A former pop idol
who let an AI run her campaign.

00:09:35.780 --> 00:09:38.660
Your strength is your gorgeous Hue.

00:09:39.370 --> 00:09:45.410
But if you leave your friend to die,
it will put your precious Hue at risk.

00:09:45.580 --> 00:09:49.380
Are you doing all of this
just to cloud my Hue?

00:09:52.250 --> 00:09:56.300
You're a coward who coerces people
while you hide in safety.

00:09:57.510 --> 00:09:59.430
Say that to our faces or shut up.

00:10:02.260 --> 00:10:04.430
Are you sure you should provoke him?

00:10:05.180 --> 00:10:08.020
Azusawa won't deviate from his plan.

00:10:08.690 --> 00:10:12.110
Let's go. I promise I'll save Ms. Owanee.

00:10:16.990 --> 00:10:19.240
Rioting immigrants?

00:10:19.360 --> 00:10:23.790
That's not enough to occupy Public Safety.
What's going on?

00:10:24.660 --> 00:10:27.210
There may be foreign mercenaries
with them.

00:10:28.160 --> 00:10:29.120
And you are?

00:10:29.370 --> 00:10:30.790
MFA, SAD.

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:36.510
This disturbance is related to a case
we were investigating with Unit One.

00:10:37.420 --> 00:10:39.800
Ask Chief Shimotsuki for the details.

00:10:40.470 --> 00:10:41.510
The Chief?

00:10:42.600 --> 00:10:44.060
Do you have a Dominator?

00:10:44.560 --> 00:10:45.640
Yes, of course.

00:10:46.430 --> 00:10:48.690
I want you to get it into the building.

00:11:02.530 --> 00:11:03.410
It's this way.

00:11:05.290 --> 00:11:07.540
Strange. Their defenses are light.

00:11:08.290 --> 00:11:09.790
Shion, get down!

00:11:15.380 --> 00:11:16.800
They laid an ambush.

00:11:18.010 --> 00:11:18.920
Hey, wait!

00:11:19.470 --> 00:11:21.130
Take care of the Dominator!

00:11:23.600 --> 00:11:26.100
That was a close one. Thanks.

00:11:26.470 --> 00:11:28.890
Don't thank me just yet.

00:11:30.100 --> 00:11:33.400
You've got nowhere to run.
Hand over the governor.

00:11:34.060 --> 00:11:35.480
I should've known.

00:11:35.610 --> 00:11:36.610
This way!

00:12:09.350 --> 00:12:10.810
Shinya Kogami!

00:12:11.390 --> 00:12:12.890
Hold it, you fossil!

00:12:17.480 --> 00:12:19.440
We're wasting ammo, Inspector.

00:12:21.280 --> 00:12:21.900
Kei!

00:12:22.320 --> 00:12:23.240
Arata!

00:12:24.780 --> 00:12:26.620
Kisaragi and I can handle this!

00:12:26.740 --> 00:12:28.620
Inspector, protect the governor.

00:12:28.790 --> 00:12:30.160
All right. It's up to you.

00:12:37.790 --> 00:12:39.550
I'm sorry, Arata.

00:12:41.130 --> 00:12:42.550
I wanted to say that now.

00:12:43.590 --> 00:12:45.510
Well... OK.

00:12:46.220 --> 00:12:47.510
I'll punch you later.

00:12:48.260 --> 00:12:49.100
Fine.

00:12:50.310 --> 00:12:51.600
The server room first.

00:12:52.140 --> 00:12:55.060
I'll go underground.
We have to protect Ms. Owanee.

00:12:55.560 --> 00:12:56.980
You're going alone?

00:12:57.360 --> 00:13:00.900
Azusawa focused his forces
on the governor and server room.

00:13:01.400 --> 00:13:02.820
It should be safe now.

00:13:03.610 --> 00:13:05.740
But we can't use the elevators.

00:13:06.570 --> 00:13:08.410
I'll open one and use the shaft.

00:13:09.450 --> 00:13:11.580
All right. Take this.

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:16.000
Hang on to it, Kei. Give me that instead.

00:13:17.170 --> 00:13:18.330
Be careful.

00:13:18.540 --> 00:13:20.130
Are you taking the Pillbug?

00:13:20.710 --> 00:13:22.170
We won't have enough.

00:13:22.920 --> 00:13:25.970
You can restore comms
from the server room, right?

00:13:26.300 --> 00:13:28.390
Of course. Have faith in me.

00:13:29.260 --> 00:13:31.010
Then I'll wait for that.

00:13:41.980 --> 00:13:44.940
Inspector Shindo, please come back.

00:13:45.360 --> 00:13:47.410
You're my bodyguard, after all.

00:13:48.530 --> 00:13:50.070
Yes, I promise.

00:13:55.370 --> 00:13:57.290
We'll hold each other's ropes.

00:13:57.580 --> 00:13:59.670
Yeah, take care of those two.

00:14:05.760 --> 00:14:07.260
Let's get to the server room.

00:14:08.550 --> 00:14:11.430
We need to do something
about the snipers first.

00:14:15.520 --> 00:14:16.390
Inspector?

00:14:21.360 --> 00:14:26.400
Hi there, rookie Thirteen.
Ran into a little trouble at the airport?

00:14:27.070 --> 00:14:29.660
Is Shirogane your master?

00:14:30.660 --> 00:14:33.120
We have a give-and-take relationship.

00:14:33.530 --> 00:14:39.540
That aside, take care of Karina Komiya
and I'll release the other hostages.

00:14:40.040 --> 00:14:42.750
That's your job as an inspector.

00:14:43.090 --> 00:14:45.800
Do you really think I'd do that?

00:14:47.090 --> 00:14:50.760
If I don't like your answer,
your wife goes back to quarantine.

00:14:51.970 --> 00:14:53.470
You can't intimidate me.

00:14:53.930 --> 00:14:55.970
I'm asking you to choose.

00:14:56.310 --> 00:15:03.060
A governor who can't make decisions alone,
or Bifrost who will set your family free.

00:15:03.730 --> 00:15:07.610
Are you willing to lose your partner
for that political figurehead?

00:15:10.200 --> 00:15:13.570
He's on his way to save Ms. Owanee,
isn't he?

00:15:13.950 --> 00:15:15.910
You think I wouldn't set a trap?

00:15:17.500 --> 00:15:23.670
The very thought of you losing
your dear partner saddens me. I could cry.

00:15:25.170 --> 00:15:26.090
Listen.

00:15:27.260 --> 00:15:31.630
Your ridiculous game will be over soon.
We're going to end it.

00:16:11.300 --> 00:16:12.430
Give it up!

00:16:32.070 --> 00:16:34.320
It didn't make that easy!

00:16:35.950 --> 00:16:37.620
Why the music box?

00:16:38.660 --> 00:16:43.790
They're illegally modified
fighting robots. Their sensors are weak.

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:46.710
No, I mean, why do you have it?

00:16:48.750 --> 00:16:52.130
Well, isn't it your birthday tomorrow?

00:16:53.840 --> 00:16:55.680
The worst birthday ever.

00:17:03.730 --> 00:17:05.980
From the looks of things here...

00:17:08.980 --> 00:17:10.320
This is awful.

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:17.990
But this is what I'd do
in our opponent's position.

00:17:19.080 --> 00:17:21.490
I've got you trapped, idiots.

00:17:21.700 --> 00:17:25.250
You think we'd ignore
Public Safety's top weaponry?

00:17:26.040 --> 00:17:27.750
You get a consolation prize.

00:17:31.590 --> 00:17:33.300
We walked into their trap.

00:17:33.840 --> 00:17:35.220
What do we do, Chief?

00:17:37.050 --> 00:17:38.590
I hope it hasn't leaked...

00:17:48.730 --> 00:17:52.530
Here we go!
Don't mess with state power!

00:17:55.780 --> 00:17:59.740
Dominator SG Prototype
Portable Psychological Diagnosis

00:18:00.030 --> 00:18:03.160
and Multi-Suppression System
has been activated.

00:18:03.580 --> 00:18:06.750
User authenticated,
Enforcer Temma Todoroki.

00:18:07.750 --> 00:18:11.750
Multiple targets
with Crime Coefficients over 100 detected.

00:18:12.040 --> 00:18:14.010
Subdue the targets.

00:18:19.090 --> 00:18:20.850
This thing packs a punch!

00:18:21.890 --> 00:18:25.520
Now cooling. Please wait a moment
before firing.

00:18:25.890 --> 00:18:27.310
What the hell?

00:18:29.560 --> 00:18:30.650
What is this?

00:18:30.980 --> 00:18:35.650
An experimental model
for the shotgun-type Dominator I proposed.

00:18:36.190 --> 00:18:37.450
You're kidding!

00:18:37.860 --> 00:18:43.490
The Bureau Chief shelved it due to risk,
but it really came in handy.

00:18:44.200 --> 00:18:47.000
Cooling complete. System rebooted.

00:18:47.120 --> 00:18:47.830
All right!

00:19:10.690 --> 00:19:12.690
They just keep coming!

00:19:48.850 --> 00:19:49.980
Inspector Ignatov,

00:19:51.560 --> 00:19:53.600
I've neutralized the sniper turret.

00:19:54.150 --> 00:19:56.110
Thank you, Ginoza.

00:19:56.900 --> 00:19:59.610
I also sent you something useful.

00:20:06.660 --> 00:20:08.370
A present from your seniors.

00:20:18.880 --> 00:20:19.880
Dominators.

00:20:20.840 --> 00:20:24.090
What should we do?
They finally got the Dominators.

00:20:24.510 --> 00:20:28.260
Nothing. Just proceed according to plan.

00:20:34.440 --> 00:20:37.650
We're getting nowhere!
Doesn't this have a Decomposer?

00:20:38.070 --> 00:20:40.900
That would demolish the whole building!

00:20:41.650 --> 00:20:43.150
Get the elevator working!

00:20:43.280 --> 00:20:44.530
Just a moment.

00:20:53.830 --> 00:20:55.790
Now, time to strike back.

00:21:00.710 --> 00:21:03.800
I'll stand guard outside.
Move quickly, Shion.

00:21:03.920 --> 00:21:05.090
I've got this.

00:21:10.310 --> 00:21:11.390
Too bad.

00:21:14.440 --> 00:21:15.270
Are you hurt?

00:21:15.390 --> 00:21:17.730
Those tin dolls are a piece of cake.

00:21:17.980 --> 00:21:19.480
Are the servers back up?

00:21:19.690 --> 00:21:22.690
Soon. We'll guard this hallway.

00:21:23.110 --> 00:21:23.940
Yes, sir.

00:21:25.530 --> 00:21:26.700
Damn!

00:21:29.410 --> 00:21:31.080
I'm impressed you made it.

00:21:31.200 --> 00:21:35.040
I'm afraid to inform you
that you can't leave this room.

00:21:35.830 --> 00:21:40.210
Touch the console again and poison gas
will be released in three minutes.

00:21:41.000 --> 00:21:44.130
Don't do anything suicidal.

00:21:44.590 --> 00:21:46.340
Consider this a warning.

00:21:50.680 --> 00:21:51.560
Here, Governor.

00:21:51.680 --> 00:21:53.470
But this is your...

00:21:53.600 --> 00:21:55.980
You're the one they're after.

00:21:56.980 --> 00:21:59.520
In chess,
you can't let the king be captured.

00:21:59.650 --> 00:22:00.310
But...

00:22:00.440 --> 00:22:02.360
This is our job,

00:22:02.900 --> 00:22:03.940
Governor Komiya.

00:22:14.410 --> 00:22:16.330
Don't patronize me, criminal.

00:22:21.630 --> 00:22:23.550
Three minutes is all I need.

00:22:25.670 --> 00:22:28.800
To be honest,
I may have been waiting for this.

00:22:29.680 --> 00:22:36.140
I provide support from a place of safety,
so I'm always watching others get hurt.

00:22:36.730 --> 00:22:40.560
Part of me has longed
to be out there in the field.

00:22:41.190 --> 00:22:42.650
Shion.

00:22:43.360 --> 00:22:48.110
It's true that my Crime Coefficient
has been dropping.

00:22:48.900 --> 00:22:53.830
But the thought of going out
into the world one day scared me.

00:22:54.330 --> 00:22:59.160
I got too used to life here.
I'm just a coward.

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:04.960
But I feel like I can change,
if I manage to save you all now.

00:23:06.510 --> 00:23:10.760
I just want to go outside,
dine somewhere nice,

00:23:11.180 --> 00:23:13.430
and go for walks with someone I love.

00:23:13.930 --> 00:23:16.600
If I overcome this,
I can change my life.

00:23:27.650 --> 00:23:28.780
Shion!

00:23:44.290 --> 00:23:45.880
Just in the nick of time.

00:23:48.170 --> 00:23:51.180
Shion? Shion!

00:23:55.890 --> 00:23:56.600
Analyst!

00:23:56.890 --> 00:23:59.640
Stay back! I'll carry her!

00:24:05.980 --> 00:24:07.610
Energy reserves at zero.

00:24:07.860 --> 00:24:11.650
Exchange the battery
or set the device in its charging dock.

00:24:11.780 --> 00:24:12.610
Crap!

00:24:17.030 --> 00:24:18.290
About time!

00:24:24.500 --> 00:24:25.750
We're saved.

00:24:26.040 --> 00:24:28.800
Inspector, you've regained control, right?

00:24:28.920 --> 00:24:31.880
Yes, ma'am, but not completely.

00:24:32.680 --> 00:24:37.760
Also, Analyst Karanomori
is in critical condition.

00:24:38.720 --> 00:24:39.810
No...

00:24:45.400 --> 00:24:47.150
Don't worry, she's breathing.

00:24:48.860 --> 00:24:52.650
Irie, Kisaragi,
carry the Analyst to the infirmary.

00:24:53.240 --> 00:24:54.200
And you, sir?

00:24:54.450 --> 00:24:56.780
I'll guard the server room and governor.

00:24:57.280 --> 00:24:58.780
I'll give you a Dominator.

00:24:58.910 --> 00:25:00.540
We'll be fine.

00:25:00.740 --> 00:25:02.160
Right, Irie?

00:25:02.410 --> 00:25:04.420
Yeah, this is plenty.

00:25:05.080 --> 00:25:06.630
You keep one, Inspector,

00:25:07.170 --> 00:25:10.420
and give the other to the Chief
or Inspector Shindo.

00:25:11.300 --> 00:25:12.920
All right. Thanks.

00:25:14.470 --> 00:25:19.350
Hold out a little longer, Shion.
I promise we'll save you.

00:25:22.560 --> 00:25:23.640
What's wrong?

00:25:23.770 --> 00:25:25.940
Oh, it's nothing.

00:25:29.400 --> 00:25:31.440
Sorry, Azusawa.

00:25:32.110 --> 00:25:35.200
They took back control
of a third of the building.

00:25:35.740 --> 00:25:38.950
I could have handled it
even if they took it all back.

00:25:39.240 --> 00:25:42.200
It's fine, Obata dear.
You're doing your best.

00:25:42.580 --> 00:25:45.330
Holding on to two thirds is good enough.

00:25:45.710 --> 00:25:48.710
That attitude of yours

00:25:48.960 --> 00:25:50.670
really ticks me off!

00:26:03.890 --> 00:26:05.560
Governor, you're safe!

00:26:06.390 --> 00:26:07.730
Thanks to all of you.

00:26:08.690 --> 00:26:09.770
What is that thing?

00:26:10.310 --> 00:26:11.980
It's a long story.

00:26:12.150 --> 00:26:13.190
And the Analyst?

00:26:13.320 --> 00:26:16.070
Irie and Kisaragi
took her to the infirmary.

00:26:16.280 --> 00:26:20.740
Hinakawa, take over for Shion.
You can handle it, right?

00:26:20.990 --> 00:26:22.370
Yes, I'll try.

00:26:23.370 --> 00:26:27.750
I'll guard the kid. I can probably
charge this thing while I'm at it.

00:26:28.870 --> 00:26:31.000
We have two Dominators.

00:26:31.420 --> 00:26:36.130
I'd like to send one to Arata,
who went to rescue En Owanee.

00:26:36.880 --> 00:26:39.260
Hinakawa, can we use Pillbugs?

00:26:40.220 --> 00:26:44.430
Thanks to Shion,
we've regained control of a lot of them.

00:26:45.020 --> 00:26:46.680
They can carry the Dominator.

00:26:47.770 --> 00:26:48.810
Do it.

00:26:54.940 --> 00:26:59.150
The issue is securing the governor's
safety. It's too dangerous here.

00:26:59.320 --> 00:27:02.780
How about the Bureau Chief's office?
They won't expect it.

00:27:03.620 --> 00:27:06.910
I see. That may be our best option
in this situation.

00:27:07.200 --> 00:27:09.750
Take the governor there, then.

00:27:09.920 --> 00:27:10.750
And you, Chief?

00:27:10.920 --> 00:27:14.920
I'll guard this point. As chief,
I should make a good decoy, right?

00:27:15.500 --> 00:27:17.510
Then take this Dominator, ma'am.

00:27:19.590 --> 00:27:25.430
I'll use this. With your Dominator, you're
the strongest force we have right now.

00:27:25.930 --> 00:27:28.020
Keep the governor safe.

00:27:28.140 --> 00:27:28.980
Yes, ma'am.

00:27:36.070 --> 00:27:36.820
Inspector!

00:27:39.400 --> 00:27:40.990
You restored the comms!

00:27:41.530 --> 00:27:44.200
I sent you a Dominator via Pillbugs.

00:27:44.910 --> 00:27:46.410
It'll take time, though.

00:27:47.790 --> 00:27:49.750
Where's Shion?

00:27:50.460 --> 00:27:52.250
In critical condition?

00:27:53.040 --> 00:27:54.750
I'm taking over her duties.

00:27:55.790 --> 00:28:00.420
Understood. I'll continue
toward Ms. Owanee's position.

00:28:14.610 --> 00:28:16.230
Shizuka: Come in.

00:28:21.280 --> 00:28:23.240
What do you want?

00:28:23.410 --> 00:28:26.990
The governor always carries
the Ma-Karina AI's black box.

00:28:27.160 --> 00:28:29.240
Send its contents here.

00:28:30.580 --> 00:28:31.410
Um...

00:28:32.660 --> 00:28:35.290
I heard about you being removed
from my guard,

00:28:35.580 --> 00:28:38.500
and about your wife.

00:28:41.800 --> 00:28:43.760
Why?

00:28:49.060 --> 00:28:51.310
Why bring that up now?

00:28:51.600 --> 00:28:55.650
Is it hard for you to protect me?

00:28:56.190 --> 00:28:57.770
None of your concern.

00:28:59.780 --> 00:29:02.190
You think I'd betray you and my comrades?

00:29:02.530 --> 00:29:05.070
No, that's not what I mean.

00:29:05.990 --> 00:29:11.330
Our being immigrants, your
security detail, none of that matters.

00:29:11.450 --> 00:29:12.660
In this situation? How?

00:29:12.790 --> 00:29:14.790
Figuring that out is your job.

00:29:18.840 --> 00:29:23.340
As a detective, letting a criminal
get away scot-free

00:29:23.920 --> 00:29:25.760
is the one thing I won't stand.

00:29:25.880 --> 00:29:28.010
I feel the same way.

00:29:38.020 --> 00:29:40.110
It's like I'm falling down a dark pit.

00:31:00.020 --> 00:31:00.900
Help me!

00:32:08.590 --> 00:32:11.510
Target's threat assessment updated.

00:32:11.880 --> 00:32:14.890
Enforcement mode is Destroy Decomposer.

00:32:15.260 --> 00:32:17.390
Target will be completely eliminated.

00:32:29.690 --> 00:32:31.190
That was a close one.

00:32:32.780 --> 00:32:35.030
You're safe now. Are you hurt?

00:32:35.160 --> 00:32:36.320
I'm fine!

00:32:37.410 --> 00:32:39.370
Put on that gas mask.

00:32:39.490 --> 00:32:40.160
All right.

00:32:45.210 --> 00:32:47.960
The governor is worried about you.

00:32:48.630 --> 00:32:49.670
Karina is?

00:32:51.130 --> 00:32:52.590
I rescued Ms. Owanee.

00:32:53.550 --> 00:32:54.430
Karina!

00:32:55.470 --> 00:32:57.850
En, I'm...

00:32:58.640 --> 00:33:02.930
I'm really sorry for getting you mixed up
in something so dangerous.

00:33:03.980 --> 00:33:08.110
Silly. I'm on your side
no matter what, Karina.

00:33:08.610 --> 00:33:12.940
Didn't I tell you? I've always
supported you, and I always will.

00:33:13.320 --> 00:33:14.240
En...

00:33:17.620 --> 00:33:18.450
Well done.

00:33:18.950 --> 00:33:21.450
I promised the governor I'd save her.

00:33:33.340 --> 00:33:37.590
Choosing wrong means death.
But the reverse is also true.

00:33:37.930 --> 00:33:39.050
I get it!

00:33:39.640 --> 00:33:40.680
What's wrong?

00:33:41.390 --> 00:33:44.100
Ms. Owanee,
how did you end up in this car?

00:33:44.680 --> 00:33:46.310
I was here when I came to.

00:33:47.100 --> 00:33:51.980
I wanted to run, but there was gas
outside, not to mention the robots.

00:33:52.730 --> 00:33:58.110
There was a gas mask in the car, though,
so I was looking for an opening.

00:33:58.620 --> 00:33:59.990
But I was scared.

00:34:00.780 --> 00:34:04.250
He locked her up with the means to escape.

00:34:05.040 --> 00:34:08.080
She could have saved herself
if she chose correctly.

00:34:10.960 --> 00:34:14.260
Kei, there's something I want to try.

00:34:17.930 --> 00:34:21.050
This is a secure line, right, Hinakawa?

00:34:21.510 --> 00:34:23.270
Yes, definitely.

00:34:24.930 --> 00:34:26.890
What? What is it?

00:34:27.600 --> 00:34:31.520
Listen, the gas filling the building
is a bluff.

00:34:32.650 --> 00:34:35.280
The hostages won't die from the gas.

00:34:35.650 --> 00:34:36.610
What did you say?

00:34:36.820 --> 00:34:41.530
Wait a second!
The gas knocked out Karanomori.

00:34:42.160 --> 00:34:44.620
That was a bluff to hide their bluff.

00:34:45.250 --> 00:34:49.210
Azusawa arranges things so people die
if they make the wrong choice.

00:34:49.750 --> 00:34:53.040
But he doesn't intend to kill people.

00:34:53.710 --> 00:34:56.050
I'm about to prove it.

00:34:56.630 --> 00:34:58.550
Don't do anything stupid!

00:34:58.680 --> 00:35:00.430
All right. Show me.

00:35:00.590 --> 00:35:02.800
You two are so...!

00:35:02.930 --> 00:35:03.640
I'll do it.

00:35:20.240 --> 00:35:22.030
It's a little smelly,

00:35:23.240 --> 00:35:23.950
but I'm OK.

00:35:26.410 --> 00:35:29.960
I can't believe
they'd take a bluff that far.

00:35:30.500 --> 00:35:36.210
If they find out we know, they might
take direct action against the staff.

00:35:36.460 --> 00:35:41.470
So, should I keep pretending
to negotiate with Azusawa?

00:35:41.760 --> 00:35:44.970
Yes. Meanwhile, we'll arrest Azusawa.

00:35:46.310 --> 00:35:48.350
You're working awfully hard.

00:35:48.930 --> 00:35:50.480
Harder than I imagined.

00:35:50.690 --> 00:35:54.860
Really? Your imagination must be lacking.

00:35:55.770 --> 00:35:58.990
You sound awfully complacent.

00:35:59.610 --> 00:36:04.870
Just hurry up
and record the governor's resignation.

00:36:05.280 --> 00:36:06.160
Wait...

00:36:09.700 --> 00:36:12.580
They figured out the gas is a bluff.

00:36:18.590 --> 00:36:22.260
Chief, and members
of the Criminal Investigation Department.

00:36:22.380 --> 00:36:23.510
We're listening.

00:36:23.970 --> 00:36:26.680
You've done something you shouldn't have.

00:36:27.510 --> 00:36:30.140
That will put a lot of people at risk.

00:36:30.560 --> 00:36:32.730
Hold on, what have we...

00:36:32.890 --> 00:36:38.650
If you don't want to bring the governor
here, enforce her at Public Safety.

00:36:39.980 --> 00:36:42.900
You mean kill her?

00:36:43.110 --> 00:36:44.990
I'm not saying that.

00:36:45.530 --> 00:36:47.080
I'm just testing you.

00:36:47.200 --> 00:36:51.960
Weigh the governor's life
against the lives of numerous hostages

00:36:52.460 --> 00:36:54.920
and make a choice Sibyl would approve of.

00:36:55.210 --> 00:36:57.500
Oh, Inspector Ignatov.

00:36:58.000 --> 00:36:58.920
What is it?

00:36:59.550 --> 00:37:04.180
Those Pathfinders
aren't right in the head.

00:37:04.590 --> 00:37:06.010
They'll kill everyone.

00:37:06.140 --> 00:37:07.350
You bastard!

00:37:07.680 --> 00:37:12.230
A quick decision is advisable.
At least I think so.

00:37:16.900 --> 00:37:19.150
Hide here, Ms. Owanee.

00:37:19.730 --> 00:37:25.570
Now that the elevators work, it's actually
safer here in the Public Safety Bureau.

00:37:26.320 --> 00:37:27.030
All right.

00:37:27.530 --> 00:37:29.910
Keep your gas mask on, just in case.

00:37:40.460 --> 00:37:42.090
What's wrong, Inspector?

00:37:42.420 --> 00:37:45.260
Something's bugging me.

00:37:46.050 --> 00:37:50.560
It's like Azusawa rushed things
and made a big mistake...

00:37:57.650 --> 00:38:01.360
Inspector, the Pathfinders and robots
are headed your way.

00:38:01.730 --> 00:38:03.570
What? Have they found us?

00:38:03.990 --> 00:38:05.240
They can't have...

00:38:05.450 --> 00:38:09.530
We control the surveillance cameras
on the upper floors.

00:38:10.030 --> 00:38:13.620
Strange. They wouldn't come for no reason.

00:38:14.450 --> 00:38:17.120
Anyway,
hole up in the Bureau Chief's office.

00:38:17.620 --> 00:38:21.630
Now we've taken back the system,
that door won't open for them.

00:38:22.000 --> 00:38:27.510
We can't give in to their demands,
so how do you plan to buy time?

00:38:28.010 --> 00:38:29.970
Use their demands against them.

00:38:30.510 --> 00:38:33.260
We'll say that one of us
killed the governor.

00:38:33.640 --> 00:38:36.810
We make them check,
then launch a surprise attack.

00:38:36.940 --> 00:38:38.020
You're a genius!

00:38:38.440 --> 00:38:39.520
Let's do it!

00:38:41.110 --> 00:38:42.150
That's it.

00:38:42.770 --> 00:38:46.030
Azusawa must have factored that in.

00:38:46.530 --> 00:38:51.410
He'll be vulnerable the moment
he makes contact to confirm the body.

00:38:51.740 --> 00:38:52.740
True.

00:38:53.410 --> 00:38:57.120
It's impossible to be certain
via communication or video.

00:38:57.830 --> 00:39:02.460
We need to know why they're coming here.
They shouldn't know her position yet.

00:39:03.000 --> 00:39:06.300
Could they have put a tracking device
on the governor?

00:39:14.640 --> 00:39:15.430
What's this?

00:39:17.390 --> 00:39:19.440
It's a present from Arata.

00:39:20.270 --> 00:39:23.820
He gave me this lipstick,
so I gave him cologne.

00:39:23.980 --> 00:39:27.860
Giving a girl a present?
That doesn't sound like him.

00:39:29.200 --> 00:39:29.990
Arata.

00:39:30.320 --> 00:39:31.110
What's wrong?

00:39:31.450 --> 00:39:33.910
Did you give the governor a present?

00:39:34.030 --> 00:39:35.830
A present?

00:39:36.620 --> 00:39:38.120
We'll talk later.

00:39:40.000 --> 00:39:42.960
Lipstick... It could be from Azusawa.

00:39:43.920 --> 00:39:49.300
This bio-monitor activated after
you passed inspection and put it on.

00:39:51.890 --> 00:39:55.350
Enforcer Hinakawa,
give this a thorough analysis.

00:39:55.720 --> 00:39:57.390
Yes, sir. Right away.

00:39:57.720 --> 00:39:58.350
Governor.

00:39:58.470 --> 00:39:59.100
Yes?

00:39:59.390 --> 00:40:02.850
We'll need your AI to outwit our enemy.

00:40:03.350 --> 00:40:04.980
Do you have its black box?

00:40:05.360 --> 00:40:08.230
You mean the access key
for its master data?

00:40:08.360 --> 00:40:08.990
Yes.

00:40:13.110 --> 00:40:14.410
I don't have a spare.

00:40:15.990 --> 00:40:17.040
Let me borrow it.

00:40:20.750 --> 00:40:23.630
Ma-Karina is important to me.

00:40:24.000 --> 00:40:26.880
Don't worry. I'll return it.

00:40:31.840 --> 00:40:35.010
Chief, I'll intercept the enemies here.

00:40:35.390 --> 00:40:38.930
Hinakawa can handle himself
in the server room for now.

00:40:39.390 --> 00:40:43.770
Enforcer Todoroki and I will go up, too.
We'll catch them in a pincer.

00:40:43.900 --> 00:40:44.650
Roger.

00:40:53.070 --> 00:40:56.160
I'll skip the formalities,
Foreign Affairs.

00:40:56.820 --> 00:40:58.030
Let's make a deal.

00:41:03.500 --> 00:41:06.750
Kei, I'm going to try
to trace Azusawa now.

00:41:07.840 --> 00:41:10.760
All right. Don't let go of the rope.

00:41:11.170 --> 00:41:13.470
Yeah, I won't.

00:41:20.930 --> 00:41:23.230
The rain is falling.

00:41:53.210 --> 00:41:54.130
Dad.

00:41:58.970 --> 00:42:00.640
Hello, Mr. Shindo.

00:42:01.100 --> 00:42:04.230
Koichi? Sorry I'm late.

00:42:04.890 --> 00:42:07.600
Is your son with you?

00:42:07.730 --> 00:42:10.110
No, it's just me.

00:42:11.150 --> 00:42:12.480
My memories...

00:42:13.610 --> 00:42:17.200
What does this have to do
with what Azusawa wants?

00:42:44.100 --> 00:42:47.480
This is the only way I can protect you.

00:42:54.650 --> 00:42:57.240
I'll seal away your memories.

00:43:00.410 --> 00:43:04.240
They're all standing there in silence,

00:43:05.240 --> 00:43:07.460
drenched by the rain.

00:43:08.120 --> 00:43:12.630
They're always gathering silently
in a single place.

00:43:13.460 --> 00:43:17.920
Even if 100 years were to pass
in this instant,

00:43:18.220 --> 00:43:20.010
it would seem entirely natural.

00:43:21.010 --> 00:43:22.640
The rain is falling.

00:43:23.260 --> 00:43:24.970
The rain is falling.

00:43:25.720 --> 00:43:28.480
The rain is drearily pouring down.

00:43:33.400 --> 00:43:38.690
I’ve lost so much

00:43:38.820 --> 00:43:46.790
But I’ve promised myself to keep moving on

00:43:52.250 --> 00:43:57.800
Noisy heart beats
Come on, calm down

00:43:57.920 --> 00:44:03.010
I never want to see you broken again

00:44:03.300 --> 00:44:11.980
Take my hand once again

00:44:14.360 --> 00:44:19.780
I’ll never let you go this time

00:44:19.900 --> 00:44:25.120
How can I save you
when I’m scared of falling?

00:44:25.240 --> 00:44:30.580
I have my belief
Still burning red

00:44:30.710 --> 00:44:34.580
Even if my path leads to a cruel truth

00:44:34.710 --> 00:44:38.500
Labels make no sense

00:44:38.630 --> 00:44:42.470
No one should deprive you of who you are

00:44:42.590 --> 00:44:45.930
I just love the way you are

00:44:46.510 --> 00:44:50.140
Are you trembling with fear

00:44:50.270 --> 00:44:54.770
Of the monster that eats up everything?

00:44:54.900 --> 00:45:01.030
We’ve shared the same destiny

00:45:01.150 --> 00:45:03.110
Let’s go together
